== Synergies and Counters ==
<pvxbig>;Performs well with/against:
*With an enchantment for [[golden lotus strike@14].
*With damage support such as [[splinter weapon@16], [[strength of honor], [[order of pain]/[[order of the vampire], [[ebon battle standard of honor@10], [[Great Dwarf weapon@10], [[gust] (or other speed boosts).
*With adrenaline support such as [[weapon of fury], [[dark fury].
*With party members that spread conditions via [[extend conditions], [[fevered dreams] or [[epidemic].
*Against casters.
*Against single targets and small groups of foes.
;Performs poorly with/against:
* Against large and very large groups of foes.
* Against general anti-physical.
* Against general anti-melee. 
* Against kiting targets.
* Against attack punishment like [[empathy] or [[insidious parasite].
* Against action punishment like [[visions of regret] or [[spiteful spirit].
* {{skill pvxicon|Plague Signet}}</pvxbig>
== Notes ==
*<pvxbig>Heroes use [[skull crack] as an interruption against skills, not just spells.
*Heroes use skull cracks on targets already suffering from dazed condition.</pvxbig>
